    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "fad4a799_50e5c893",
        "filename": "core/jni/com_android_internal_content_FileSystemUtils.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 9
      },
      "lineNbr": 86,
      "author": {
        "id": 1120458
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-04-06T00:30:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "do we know the maximum possible size of this? If it\u0027s like a 100MB APK with all 0s, I wonder if we could run out of memory and should read it in chunks?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 86,
        "startChar": 36,
        "endLine": 86,
        "endChar": 44
      },
      "revId": "d2a001a4762d18144ec6c9a743c3d26bb77b9638",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "6b0d5f9f_d20236a2",
        "filename": "core/jni/com_android_internal_content_FileSystemUtils.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 9
      },
      "lineNbr": 86,
      "author": {
        "id": 1499410
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-04-06T01:32:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The padding should be no more than 12KB for 16kB-alignment and no more than 60kB for 64kB alignment. I don\u0027t think static linker supports arbitrarily large p_align. We could read in 60kB chunks to be safe.",
      "parentUuid": "fad4a799_50e5c893",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 86,
        "startChar": 36,
        "endLine": 86,
        "endChar": 44
      },
      "revId": "d2a001a4762d18144ec6c9a743c3d26bb77b9638",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "8a1ff1dc_b9949e2e",
        "filename": "core/jni/com_android_internal_content_FileSystemUtils.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 9
      },
      "lineNbr": 86,
      "author": {
        "id": 1120458
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-04-08T18:16:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The maximum APK size is 100MB, but I\u0027m not sure if there is a limit on the .so\u0027s. Chunking might be needed for larger APKs or .so\u0027s with an unexpected format.",
      "parentUuid": "6b0d5f9f_d20236a2",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 86,
        "startChar": 36,
        "endLine": 86,
        "endChar": 44
      },
      "revId": "d2a001a4762d18144ec6c9a743c3d26bb77b9638",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "33e7b1c4_7b312e99",
        "filename": "core/jni/com_android_internal_content_FileSystemUtils.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 9
      },
      "lineNbr": 86,
      "author": {
        "id": 1956258
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-04-09T22:04:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "ReadFullyAtOffset API doesn\u0027t return how much data is read in given buffer. Which means provided buffer will need clearing after each read. Without read length info, it will be hard to tell if the zeros in read buffer are from file or buffer itself.",
      "parentUuid": "4e8d76e7_8fcdbaa7",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 86,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 86,
        "endChar": 46
      },
      "revId": "d2a001a4762d18144ec6c9a743c3d26bb77b9638",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "3ca80d90_34b019f5",
        "filename": "core/jni/com_android_internal_content_FileSystemUtils.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 9
      },
      "lineNbr": 86,
      "author": {
        "id": 1956258
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-04-09T22:04:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "this was done to avoid repeated I/O. there is log for this and we can use find-logs to see if there are any more cases like this. I will followup for chunk reads. Also, ReadOffsetFully doesn\u0027t return how much data is actually read. This has to be fixed first to resolve the chunk reads. If it reaches end of the file while chunking, last chunk will never be punched.",
      "parentUuid": "8a1ff1dc_b9949e2e",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 86,
        "startChar": 36,
        "endLine": 86,
        "endChar": 44
      },
      "revId": "d2a001a4762d18144ec6c9a743c3d26bb77b9638",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "e8dcdfca_4c18dfa4",
        "filename": "core/jni/com_android_internal_content_FileSystemUtils.cpp",
